  "ALL FIELD CABLES ARE SCHEDULED DIRECT FROM PANEL TO DEVICE; NO JUNCTION BOXES ARE USED.",
  "SPARE WAYS WITH NO CABLE (MSB-01 F6, MCC-01 SP1) ARE NOT SHOWN.",
  "ALL CABLES TO BE INSTALLED IN ACCORDANCE WITH BS 7671:2018 (AS AMENDED) REQUIREMENTS FOR ELECTRICAL INSTALLATIONS (IET WIRING REGULATIONS 18TH EDITION).",
  "ALL SIGNAL/INSTRUMENTATION CABLES SHALL BE SEGREGATED FROM POWER CABLES AND INSTALLED IN ACCORDANCE WITH BS 7671 REGULATION 528.1 (BAND I AND BAND II SEPARATION).",
  "VSD MOTOR CABLES C-012 TO C-015 ARE EMC SCREENED AND TERMINATED WITH EMC GLANDS.",
  "ALL CABLE CONTAINMENT, SUPPORTS AND FIXINGS TO BE INSTALLED IN ACCORDANCE WITH MANUFACTURER'S RECOMMENDATIONS AND BS 7671 SECTION 522.",
  "VENDOR SUPPLIED CABLES AND CONNECTIONS TO BE VERIFIED AGAINST VENDOR DOCUMENTATION PRIOR TO INSTALLATION.",
  "CABLE IDENTIFICATION LABELS TO BE FITTED AT BOTH ENDS OF EACH CABLE AND AT EVERY DRAW-IN POINT IN ACCORDANCE WITH BS 7671 REGULATION 514.",
